WEBVTT

00:13.310 --> 00:16.250
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:17.440 --> 00:20.090
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.090 --> 00:25.500
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:26.970 --> 00:30.520
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.070 --> 00:35.360
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:36.320 --> 00:39.870
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:40.860 --> 00:43.070
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.070 --> 00:46.110
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.110 --> 00:48.190
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.190 --> 00:52.250
♪I have no regrets♪

00:52.760 --> 00:57.530
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:57.530 --> 01:01.820
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:01.820 --> 01:03.230
♪Over the time♪

01:03.230 --> 01:05.239
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:05.239 --> 01:08.090
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.090 --> 01:11.360
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:11.360 --> 01:16.060
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:16.760 --> 01:24.410
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.080 --> 01:42.440
=Sword and Fairy=

01:42.520 --> 01:46.220
=Episode 33=

01:50.280 --> 01:50.800
Ju Shifang.

01:51.880 --> 01:53.200
You shouldn't be here.

01:54.240 --> 01:55.520
We're enemies, not friends.

01:55.920 --> 01:56.759
I won't show mercy

01:57.080 --> 01:58.240
on the battlefield.

01:59.720 --> 02:00.480
I want to...

02:00.880 --> 02:02.360
I want to see Miss Shuo Xuan.

02:03.320 --> 02:04.960
You think you can just
ask to see our lord?

02:06.120 --> 02:07.360
Who do you think you are?

02:08.080 --> 02:08.560
Take him away.

02:10.880 --> 02:11.480
Let go.

02:20.160 --> 02:20.840
Shuo Xuan.

02:23.079 --> 02:24.240
Why bother catching a loser?

02:32.120 --> 02:33.200
Why are you here?

02:35.200 --> 02:35.600
I...

02:36.520 --> 02:37.440
I came here...

02:38.440 --> 02:39.480
Miss Shuo Xuan.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.600
I'm here to challenge you.

02:42.320 --> 02:43.320
You?

02:44.720 --> 02:45.400
I know.

02:45.920 --> 02:47.040
You think I'm a loser.

02:48.079 --> 02:49.800
But I have to stop you.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.320
You have the key ring of Rehai, right?

02:52.400 --> 02:54.280
Can you stop eyeing Rehai?

02:55.040 --> 02:55.920
Ying Xuwei said

02:56.160 --> 02:57.640
that he had enough Qiyuan Orbs.

02:58.000 --> 02:58.480
You fool!

02:59.240 --> 03:00.440
You think you can stop us?

03:00.760 --> 03:01.880
Don't try to be a hero.

03:01.880 --> 03:02.760
I'm not trying.

03:03.920 --> 03:05.480
I'm just doing what I want

03:06.080 --> 03:07.400
and protecting people I care about.

03:08.880 --> 03:09.440
You said that

03:10.240 --> 03:12.320
the people of the Yu Clan value

03:12.560 --> 03:13.680
absolute power.

03:14.440 --> 03:15.680
I'd like to challenge you now.

03:16.320 --> 03:17.160
If I win,

03:17.160 --> 03:19.280
you will listen to me
and not open up Rehai.

03:20.040 --> 03:20.560
Otherwise...

03:22.120 --> 03:22.560
Otherwise...

03:23.760 --> 03:25.440
Otherwise, you're not a hero.

03:27.079 --> 03:27.840
Madman.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.320
You can kill him.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.520
But don't make fun of his resolution.

03:36.120 --> 03:36.880
Say no more.

03:37.640 --> 03:38.079
Let him go.

04:10.080 --> 04:12.360
You still have time to take it back.

04:16.279 --> 04:17.240
I won't take it back.

04:17.959 --> 04:18.880
I will win.

05:11.400 --> 05:12.200
Dou Bao.

05:13.280 --> 05:13.760
Dou Bao.

05:15.440 --> 05:15.880
Dou Bao.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.000
Dou Bao.

05:19.200 --> 05:19.800
Dou Bao.

05:23.960 --> 05:24.480
Dou Bao.

05:30.720 --> 05:31.440
Dou Bao.

05:35.760 --> 05:36.280
Dou Bao.

05:44.320 --> 05:44.960
You lost.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.040
Won't you give up?

06:05.760 --> 06:06.720
I once said that

06:08.280 --> 06:09.200
if we had to

06:10.040 --> 06:11.200
fight each other one day,

06:12.160 --> 06:13.800
I'd lead you to the right path.

06:15.120 --> 06:15.960
But I've said that

06:16.800 --> 06:18.880
I'm already walking the right path.

06:19.960 --> 06:20.760
Miss Shuo Xuan.

06:22.600 --> 06:23.520
Do you remember?

06:24.440 --> 06:26.080
When we first met,

06:26.920 --> 06:28.080
you said that

06:29.200 --> 06:30.960
if I went close to you,

06:32.080 --> 06:33.640
you'd tear me apart.

06:34.640 --> 06:36.320
If you come close to me again,

06:37.000 --> 06:38.920
I'll tear you apart.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.159
I remember that.

07:41.080 --> 07:42.240
I may not have a chance

07:43.240 --> 07:45.159
to say it out loud if I don't do it now.

07:47.200 --> 07:47.960
I'm timid,

07:49.159 --> 07:50.920
weak, and selfish.

07:56.560 --> 07:57.440
But I've

07:58.400 --> 07:59.120
always been

08:00.120 --> 08:02.160
following your steps,

08:04.400 --> 08:05.280
and I've been

08:06.120 --> 08:07.000
dreaming

08:07.920 --> 08:10.120
of being a hero or a great man that

08:11.080 --> 08:12.080
you'd respect.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.040
It's...

08:46.920 --> 08:47.640
It's just that

08:49.080 --> 08:50.880
we hold different sets of values.

08:52.000 --> 08:52.720
So...

08:53.600 --> 08:54.680
So we're bound

08:55.760 --> 08:57.160
to be enemies.

09:18.520 --> 09:19.040
Ju Shifang.

09:19.480 --> 09:19.960
Enough!

09:21.040 --> 09:22.040
No matter how it ends,

09:22.600 --> 09:23.640
I admire your courage.

09:24.320 --> 09:24.760
Go back.

09:32.920 --> 09:33.840
Surrender.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.560
This is not a fight.

09:36.040 --> 09:37.200
It's a suicide.

10:04.760 --> 10:06.200
Ju Shifang, stop there.

10:07.800 --> 10:09.120
Miss Shuo Xuan.

10:11.000 --> 10:12.040
I like you.

10:12.040 --> 10:14.600
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

10:14.600 --> 10:18.150
♪They symbolize my love♪

10:18.150 --> 10:23.590
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

10:26.310 --> 10:29.720
♪Following your shadow across miles♪

10:32.360 --> 10:36.420
♪Like a bird chasing
the clouds to the horizon♪

10:40.320 --> 10:43.600
I'm sorry.

10:44.870 --> 10:48.560
♪My heart can't help
but draw near to you♪

10:48.560 --> 10:49.520
Shuo Xuan.

10:51.300 --> 10:53.910
♪If love arises with the wind♪

10:53.910 --> 10:57.650
♪How do I calm it♪

10:57.650 --> 11:00.290
♪I've given it my all♪

11:00.290 --> 11:03.880
♪But our paths just don't cross♪

11:03.880 --> 11:06.560
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

11:06.560 --> 11:10.390
♪They symbolize my love♪

11:10.390 --> 11:16.490
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

11:21.840 --> 11:22.480
Shifang.

11:25.120 --> 11:26.600
Shifang...

11:27.160 --> 11:27.760
Shifang.

11:30.520 --> 11:32.120
Weird. Where is he?

11:45.920 --> 11:46.400
(Jinzhao.)

11:47.280 --> 11:47.960
(Little Yue.)

11:48.720 --> 11:49.400
(Zhaoyan.)

11:50.040 --> 11:50.640
(Xian Qing.)

11:51.600 --> 11:52.280
(Miss Ming.)

11:54.120 --> 11:56.200
(It feels kind of awkward)

11:56.920 --> 11:58.720
(to write down your names like this.)

12:01.960 --> 12:03.120
(I'd been hiding)

12:04.120 --> 12:05.840
(in my little world before I met you.)

12:07.760 --> 12:09.320
(Many things happened)

12:09.920 --> 12:11.040
(while I was with you.)

12:12.320 --> 12:14.640
(Some were not that pleasant,)

12:16.240 --> 12:16.760
(but)

12:17.760 --> 12:19.840
(it felt like I woke up from a dream)

12:21.160 --> 12:23.600
(and finally saw the world for real.)

12:25.640 --> 12:26.480
(It can be bad.)

12:27.560 --> 12:28.240
(It can be nice.)

12:32.200 --> 12:32.840
(Now,)

12:33.800 --> 12:35.720
(I finally have the courage)

12:37.080 --> 12:38.640
(to make up for my mistakes)

12:39.840 --> 12:41.320
(and protect the people I care about.)

12:45.480 --> 12:46.480
(I'm glad)

12:47.360 --> 12:48.320
(to be of help,)

12:49.720 --> 12:52.280
(although I'm still a bit scared.)

12:59.320 --> 13:00.000
(I'm sorry.)

13:01.560 --> 13:03.160
- Shifang.
(- I dare not say goodbye to you.)

13:03.160 --> 13:03.840
Shifang.

13:05.040 --> 13:06.800
(I dare not see Yang)

13:08.240 --> 13:10.080
(and our leader.)

13:12.600 --> 13:13.560
(Please)

13:14.680 --> 13:16.080
(say sorry for me.)

13:21.400 --> 13:22.960
(I'm so lucky to have met you.)

13:24.520 --> 13:25.280
(Thank you.)

13:28.280 --> 13:28.760
(Goodbye.)

13:45.200 --> 13:46.400
Shifang.

13:47.800 --> 13:49.120
Shifang.

14:44.120 --> 14:44.560
Yue.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.480
Do I look like a hero?

14:47.160 --> 14:47.760
Jinzhao.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.120
I've been dreaming that one day

14:49.120 --> 14:50.240
you'll use my invention.

14:51.760 --> 14:53.480
I couldn't face it.

14:55.880 --> 14:57.440
I'm useless and selfish

14:58.080 --> 14:59.800
and almost got Mr. Gu killed.

15:01.680 --> 15:03.520
Sorry, Jinzhao.

15:05.280 --> 15:06.840
But I want to do better.

15:07.780 --> 15:12.680
♪Twin flowers bloom on the same branch♪

15:12.680 --> 15:17.830
♪Autumn comes and spring goes.
Eventually they fall♪

15:19.620 --> 15:21.480
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

15:21.480 --> 15:23.640
Then it's a deal.

15:23.840 --> 15:24.680
You'll celebrate

15:26.440 --> 15:28.440
my birthday every year.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.280
This day every year.

15:32.390 --> 15:33.660
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

15:34.720 --> 15:35.890
I won't change at all.

15:35.890 --> 15:37.400
♪The rain is spattering♪

15:38.440 --> 15:43.170
♪Breaking off a branch
to exchange for the memories♪

15:44.170 --> 15:49.020
♪Like threads weaving misty rain
into a painting♪

15:49.020 --> 15:54.310
♪Forming a bond
reminiscent of a rainbow♪

15:54.310 --> 16:00.780
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

16:00.780 --> 16:06.280
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

16:06.920 --> 16:13.260
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

16:13.260 --> 16:19.240
♪Don't be afraid♪

16:19.240 --> 16:25.100
♪Writing about your struggle♪

16:25.100 --> 16:31.380
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

16:31.380 --> 16:37.720
♪Betting your whole life♪

16:38.250 --> 16:43.260
♪No answer, no giving up♪

16:45.080 --> 16:45.560
Shuo Xuan.

16:46.200 --> 16:46.880
Are you alright?

16:47.520 --> 16:49.080
I won't disrupt Her Lordship's plan.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.240
Rest and be better.

16:53.320 --> 16:53.640
Right.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.680
Have you performed the Meditation Spell

16:57.320 --> 16:58.520
on Her Lordship again?

17:00.160 --> 17:01.360
It didn't work again.

17:04.560 --> 17:06.040
You're still restless.

17:07.480 --> 17:09.880
Cultivate yourself while you're resting.

17:15.480 --> 17:16.079
Lin Yuan.

17:19.760 --> 17:21.560
How did he manage to do that?

17:24.640 --> 17:25.960
Wasn't he a coward?

17:28.079 --> 17:28.960
Do you still

17:31.160 --> 17:33.240
think of him as a coward?

17:53.560 --> 17:54.560
Miss Shuo Xuan.

17:55.480 --> 17:56.800
This is for you.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.720
I'm not interested in these things.

18:06.680 --> 18:07.560
I got a nice name

18:07.840 --> 18:09.200
for this Luban lock.

18:09.720 --> 18:11.200
"To An Acquaintance."

18:14.040 --> 18:15.640
You always brush me off with some

18:15.640 --> 18:16.680
useless gadget.

18:48.880 --> 18:51.000
I-I just...

18:51.040 --> 18:52.000
You like me?

18:52.480 --> 18:53.800
(Well,)

18:53.840 --> 18:54.840
(I saw you...)

18:55.040 --> 18:57.960
(We admire heroes and warriors.)

18:58.520 --> 18:59.040
(You...)

18:59.480 --> 19:01.120
(You're a coward
who can't even defeat me.)

19:02.360 --> 19:03.280
(I've become...)

19:03.520 --> 19:05.280
(much better than before.)

19:06.520 --> 19:08.880
(If being a great hero needs)

19:09.120 --> 19:10.480
(to sacrifice many lives,)

19:10.960 --> 19:12.680
(I will give up being a hero.)

19:16.680 --> 19:17.960
(I've always dreamed)

19:18.880 --> 19:20.680
(of being a hero or a great man that)

19:21.320 --> 19:22.240
(you'd respect.)

19:23.560 --> 19:24.240
(It's just that)

19:25.520 --> 19:27.200
(we hold different sets of values.)

19:28.440 --> 19:30.040
(We're bound to be enemies.)

19:32.960 --> 19:33.800
(Miss Shuo Xuan.)

19:34.960 --> 19:35.240
(I...)

19:36.400 --> 19:37.480
(I just want to say)

19:39.360 --> 19:40.080
(sorry.)

19:42.920 --> 19:44.120
To an acquaintance.

19:48.520 --> 19:49.760
You fool.

19:53.320 --> 19:55.160
To an acquaintance.

20:00.920 --> 20:01.440
Ms. Ge.

20:02.120 --> 20:03.640
Is that true?

20:04.400 --> 20:06.160
My mom was a member of the Hengdao Sect?

20:07.520 --> 20:08.040
That's right.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.760
She left the design

20:10.800 --> 20:13.160
of Dou Bao at Yujie Hub.

20:14.440 --> 20:15.440
The Hengdao Sect was

20:15.720 --> 20:17.280
founded to pass on the techniques.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.200
It gathered

20:19.440 --> 20:21.440
those who love gadgets.

20:21.800 --> 20:24.200
But the world is in grave danger,

20:24.760 --> 20:26.280
so we're up against Zhu Yu.

20:27.920 --> 20:28.200
Then...

20:29.480 --> 20:31.640
my mom was a master of gadgets,

20:31.880 --> 20:32.320
right?

20:33.680 --> 20:34.160
Of course.

20:34.760 --> 20:37.000
She was really talented.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.520
She even

20:43.200 --> 20:45.680
designed this arm for me.

20:47.920 --> 20:48.440
Then...

20:49.600 --> 20:50.360
Then why...

20:50.480 --> 20:52.040
Why did she leave the Hengdao Sect?

20:56.640 --> 20:57.920
She fell in love with someone.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.720
Twenty years ago,

21:02.480 --> 21:03.040
your mom

21:03.960 --> 21:05.240
left the Yujie Hub

21:05.480 --> 21:07.320
to seek further development of gadgets.

21:08.280 --> 21:08.880
One day,

21:09.920 --> 21:11.880
she sent a letter to Yujie Hub saying

21:12.760 --> 21:15.160
that she met someone and no longer

21:16.080 --> 21:17.840
wanted to wander the world.

21:27.040 --> 21:28.600
I was young when my mom

21:29.520 --> 21:30.360
passed away.

21:33.200 --> 21:35.840
There are many things I don't remember.

21:37.600 --> 21:38.440
And

21:39.000 --> 21:41.040
I'm only left with Dou Bao.

21:44.200 --> 21:44.680
Your mom

21:45.560 --> 21:46.720
always said that

21:47.680 --> 21:51.040
the gadget technique
was not about making a living,

21:51.600 --> 21:53.880
but about benefiting the people.

21:54.760 --> 21:55.320
I'd like to

21:55.920 --> 21:57.200
pass on this teaching to you.

22:00.320 --> 22:02.560
I have to talk to Luohuan.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.000
See you.

22:05.680 --> 22:07.280
Thank you, Ms. Ge.

22:28.440 --> 22:28.840
Mom.

22:30.800 --> 22:31.960
I will make something

22:33.200 --> 22:34.360
more awesome.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.400
Shuo Xuan has the key ring of Rehai.

22:41.040 --> 22:43.320
I will make her recover before Rehai

22:43.520 --> 22:44.600
reaches Zangfeng Plains.

22:45.430 --> 22:46.360
Thank you, Your Lordship.

22:48.980 --> 22:49.460
Your Lordship.

22:50.230 --> 22:51.640
The Hengdao Sect
and the Zhengwu Alliance

22:51.880 --> 22:53.200
have been watching us.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.480
We'll be under attack

22:56.280 --> 22:57.520
once we open up Rehai.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.000
It's alright.

23:02.200 --> 23:03.720
The Hengdao Sect is focusing

23:04.320 --> 23:05.280
on the Zangfeng Plains.

23:05.520 --> 23:06.160
Your Lordship.

23:06.880 --> 23:08.040
Why don't we launch an attack

23:08.400 --> 23:09.280
on Yujie Hub

23:09.720 --> 23:11.240
to snatch their Qiyuan Orbs?

23:15.760 --> 23:17.840
The dark feelings of humans
will corrupt my mind

23:19.280 --> 23:22.400
if I keep consuming Qiyuan Orbs.

23:23.720 --> 23:24.600
Say no more.

23:25.840 --> 23:27.880
Make sure everything goes perfectly.

23:29.480 --> 23:29.880
Understood.

23:44.200 --> 23:45.560
Qiyuan Orbs.

23:47.960 --> 23:48.960
If I want to

23:49.640 --> 23:51.320
satisfy my hunger,

23:52.440 --> 23:55.440
the Qiyuan Orbs are not enough.

24:13.080 --> 24:14.920
(It's about
the life and death of our clan.)

24:16.200 --> 24:17.240
(I wish you were)

24:18.120 --> 24:20.120
(still that benevolent mythical beast.)

24:57.280 --> 24:57.800
Xiu.

24:59.760 --> 25:00.680
Are you bothered?

25:04.680 --> 25:05.200
Uncle,

25:08.000 --> 25:09.000
I received a letter

25:12.080 --> 25:13.320
before Mr. Ju passed away.

25:28.070 --> 25:30.600
(Come at 13:15
to the river shore of Jing'an.)

25:41.720 --> 25:42.360
I've seen

25:43.560 --> 25:44.920
this handwriting
in Luo's secret chamber.

25:46.720 --> 25:47.480
Luo Maiming.

25:50.320 --> 25:50.880
It's him.

25:54.800 --> 25:56.600
Only Shifang and you got this letter?

26:05.720 --> 26:06.280
Xiu.

26:07.440 --> 26:09.200
I haven't seen you like this for years.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.360
I guess

26:23.480 --> 26:24.040
you're thinking

26:25.560 --> 26:27.040
that if you had done something,

26:28.440 --> 26:29.720
Shifang may not be dead.

26:30.960 --> 26:31.280
Right?

26:40.240 --> 26:40.960
Don't be confused.

26:42.080 --> 26:44.280
What has happened can't be changed.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.720
It's like a fantasy

26:49.240 --> 26:49.920
or an illusion.

26:51.120 --> 26:51.880
Delving into it

26:53.120 --> 26:54.880
will only stop you from progressing.

27:04.440 --> 27:04.960
I won't.

27:07.000 --> 27:07.680
You're a tough girl.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.520
Good for you.

27:19.520 --> 27:21.040
If it was Luo Maiming's plan,

27:23.960 --> 27:25.360
I should be the one

27:26.160 --> 27:27.160
sent to die.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.640
Why didn't I get a letter?

27:33.520 --> 27:34.080
Uncle,

27:34.960 --> 27:36.040
I don't think Luo Maiming

27:36.680 --> 27:37.960
had the heart to kill you.

27:39.080 --> 27:39.480
Why not?

27:41.480 --> 27:42.280
Why wouldn't he?

27:48.840 --> 27:49.480
(I see.)

27:50.920 --> 27:51.520
(I see.)

27:53.360 --> 27:55.080
(Luo Maiming, you're so shrewd.)

27:56.960 --> 27:58.800
(He entrusted Zhaoyan to me.)

28:00.080 --> 28:02.160
(She's the one he cares about the most.)

28:08.440 --> 28:08.960
Uncle.

28:12.000 --> 28:12.960
Don't worry about me.

28:14.400 --> 28:14.920
It's late.

28:15.600 --> 28:16.360
Go to bed.

28:17.360 --> 28:20.320
Let's head back to Yujie Hub tomorrow.

29:15.840 --> 29:17.600
The Zhengwu Alliance
is heading to Zangfeng Plains.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.320
Just like Shifang, they're

29:21.480 --> 29:22.160
risking themselves

29:23.440 --> 29:25.320
to earn us a chance to kill Zhu Yu.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.040
There will be casualties

29:27.680 --> 29:28.800
in the battle against Kun.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.280
But it hasn't even started,

29:32.760 --> 29:33.560
and Shifang has...

29:38.480 --> 29:39.560
The deceased is gone.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.440
The survivors should live on.

29:42.200 --> 29:43.240
Shifang left us a lot more

29:44.080 --> 29:45.400
than a painful memory.

29:50.600 --> 29:51.520
Speaking of which,

29:52.440 --> 29:53.720
when I first met him,

29:54.600 --> 29:55.960
he was peeking at
Shuo Xuan in the shower

29:57.200 --> 29:58.640
and got kicked into the water.

30:08.760 --> 30:10.840
He showed me what a friend was like.

30:12.280 --> 30:12.720
Yeah.

30:15.320 --> 30:15.800
Strange.

30:18.280 --> 30:19.760
Since when did I stop

30:21.200 --> 30:23.240
finding him weak and timid?

30:26.440 --> 30:27.640
I'm not even surprised

30:30.440 --> 30:31.760
that he ended up like this.

30:33.680 --> 30:34.200
Yeah.

30:36.440 --> 30:37.040
We are

30:38.360 --> 30:39.880
not who we used to be.

30:49.560 --> 30:51.600
I have to save the world from Zhu Yu.

30:56.320 --> 30:56.880
Jinzhao.

30:58.720 --> 30:59.400
I'm not afraid.

31:07.720 --> 31:08.480
We are not afraid.

31:23.160 --> 31:24.320
Two of you

31:24.520 --> 31:26.160
will die soon.

31:27.320 --> 31:28.560
W-What do you mean?

31:28.920 --> 31:30.080
Don't try to scare us.

31:47.400 --> 31:48.360
This is the main control.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.360
Did you

31:55.520 --> 31:56.520
send Shifang to die?

31:58.120 --> 32:00.680
We needed to send
Yue Qi's blood to Mist Soul.

32:01.560 --> 32:03.720
We had to get access to Zhu Yu

32:03.920 --> 32:04.720
through Shuo Xuan.

32:05.760 --> 32:07.880
So Shifang had to be sacrificed?

32:10.080 --> 32:11.480
If we can't stop Zhu Yu,

32:12.160 --> 32:13.120
everybody will die.

32:14.240 --> 32:16.280
It's just a matter of time.

32:34.320 --> 32:37.560
This is the light turret
we'll use to attack Kun.

32:38.960 --> 32:42.040
I'll operate it in person tomorrow.

32:44.600 --> 32:45.800
For the Mortal Realm,

32:46.480 --> 32:48.120
I'll try my best to stop Zhu Yu.

32:50.560 --> 32:53.440
The Zhengwu Alliance will reach
Zangfeng Plains tomorrow.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.360
(Zhu Yu.)

33:00.800 --> 33:02.480
(The final battle will be tomorrow.)

33:05.380 --> 33:09.160
(Vast and boundless)

33:19.400 --> 33:20.640
Drinking alone makes you sulky.

33:21.160 --> 33:22.440
Drinking together is a pleasure.

33:23.320 --> 33:24.400
I never drink alone.

33:25.920 --> 33:26.600
I don't believe you.

33:28.720 --> 33:29.680
Whatever.

34:12.639 --> 34:14.800
You threw this coin
after so much hesitation.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.080
Won't you take a look?

34:28.840 --> 34:29.480
No need.

34:32.199 --> 34:33.000
Thanks for the wine.

34:41.800 --> 34:42.400
Hanjiang.

34:43.800 --> 34:44.560
It occurs to me

34:45.719 --> 34:48.520
that Jinzhao has your temperament.

35:01.360 --> 35:01.880
Mr. Yue.

35:02.480 --> 35:03.280
What's wrong?

35:04.000 --> 35:04.440
Miss Ming.

35:05.040 --> 35:06.120
If anything happens to me,

35:06.200 --> 35:06.680
please

35:07.400 --> 35:08.040
take care of Qi.

35:09.960 --> 35:10.400
Why?

35:11.200 --> 35:13.200
You always fight together.

35:13.800 --> 35:14.840
She won't be safe

35:15.080 --> 35:16.200
if anything happens to you.

35:16.280 --> 35:16.920
Not really.

35:17.960 --> 35:19.120
Qi has grown up.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.640
Even if I'm not there,

35:20.920 --> 35:21.440
she'll be fine

35:22.080 --> 35:22.720
around you.

35:24.560 --> 35:25.160
Jinzhao.

35:25.920 --> 35:26.960
You don't believe in fate.

35:29.400 --> 35:30.080
What is fate?

35:31.560 --> 35:32.880
Even if I knew the result,

35:33.680 --> 35:35.480
I'd do my best to fight for it.

35:36.760 --> 35:37.640
So anyway,

35:38.280 --> 35:40.160
I'll bear the consequences tomorrow.

35:43.320 --> 35:44.200
I didn't expect you

35:44.680 --> 35:45.880
to be so insightful.

35:48.440 --> 35:49.680
Anything is possible.

35:50.560 --> 35:51.040
What if?

35:52.320 --> 35:53.280
If anything goes wrong,

35:53.800 --> 35:55.160
I'll entrust

35:55.760 --> 35:56.960
the mythical beast to you.

35:58.160 --> 35:58.520
Goodbye.

36:04.800 --> 36:06.160
The gadgets of Yujie Hub

36:06.720 --> 36:08.320
can attack the physical form of Kun.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.480
But it's a mythical beast.

36:11.040 --> 36:12.960
The attack has to
land on the weakest spot

36:12.960 --> 36:13.720
to work.

36:14.640 --> 36:16.360
You've observed Zhu Yu for years

36:17.000 --> 36:17.960
and came up with

36:17.960 --> 36:19.200
three possible spots

36:19.720 --> 36:20.720
without certainty.

36:21.640 --> 36:22.480
The stored energy

36:23.200 --> 36:25.600
allows the Yujie Hub
to launch three attacks.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.560
I didn't say yes.

36:37.480 --> 36:38.760
I also have someone to protect.

36:39.880 --> 36:40.760
I can do it, too.

36:52.000 --> 36:52.480
So?

36:52.480 --> 36:53.240
Did you find her?

36:53.560 --> 36:54.960
I can't find Ming Xiu anywhere.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.520
Where can she be?

36:57.160 --> 36:58.840
Ming Xiu is a careful person.

36:59.120 --> 37:00.400
Was she compelled to leave?

37:02.680 --> 37:03.800
Ever since Hanjiang

37:04.480 --> 37:05.000
passed away,

37:05.000 --> 37:06.680
nobody could contain her.

37:07.560 --> 37:08.600
I was negligent.

37:09.280 --> 37:09.920
We must not delay.

37:10.240 --> 37:11.040
I'll open up Rehai.

37:11.280 --> 37:12.800
Try to enter Mist Soul.

37:12.880 --> 37:13.720
Let's split up.

37:14.360 --> 37:15.280
No, we shouldn't.

37:16.040 --> 37:16.880
Yeah, Zhaoyan.

37:17.080 --> 37:17.960
Let's stick together.

37:18.200 --> 37:19.680
Yeah, we can't split up.

37:24.360 --> 37:24.680
Okay.

37:25.160 --> 37:26.560
Let's face it together.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.600
Rehai

37:48.440 --> 37:49.920
has moved to Zangfeng Plains.

37:51.520 --> 37:54.160
Zhu Yu will take Shuo Xuan there.

37:55.680 --> 37:57.400
According to our plan,

37:58.040 --> 38:00.040
when Shuo Xuan uses the fake key ring

38:00.040 --> 38:01.680
to open up Rehai,

38:02.280 --> 38:04.280
Luo Zhaoyan will open up Rehai, too.

38:04.960 --> 38:05.720
Right then,

38:06.080 --> 38:06.600
Zhu Yu will

38:06.600 --> 38:08.360
unexpectedly absorb the power of Rehai.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.200
The unbinding spell will be activated

38:11.480 --> 38:13.040
and Zhu Yu will lose
Vitality Energy fast.

38:15.600 --> 38:17.120
I hope it goes well.

38:23.930 --> 38:25.570
(Zangfeng Plains)

38:31.080 --> 38:33.320
If you don't come to your senses,

38:34.200 --> 38:36.800
the Zhengwu Alliance
will fight you to the end.

38:37.120 --> 38:38.520
Mr. Zuo, you're a heroic man.

38:39.040 --> 38:39.960
If we weren't enemies,

38:40.280 --> 38:41.640
I'd make friends with you.

38:42.040 --> 38:42.880
We're enemies.

38:43.680 --> 38:44.320
Save it.

38:45.640 --> 38:46.000
Alright.

38:52.120 --> 38:52.600
Charge!

39:45.670 --> 39:47.070
♪Stars twinkle♪

39:47.070 --> 39:49.070
♪Falling on the lake's surface♪

39:49.860 --> 39:51.070
♪The bright moon gleams♪

39:51.070 --> 39:53.070
♪Illuminating your tender eyes♪

39:53.770 --> 39:55.970
♪Hearing the soft heartbeat by my side♪

39:55.970 --> 40:00.080
♪I make a wish deep within♪

40:02.070 --> 40:03.320
♪Flowers sway gently♪

40:03.320 --> 40:05.410
♪Our eyes are full of affection♪

40:05.410 --> 40:07.330
♪In a low murmur♪

40:07.330 --> 40:09.330
♪We express
our entwined hearts' desires♪

40:09.330 --> 40:12.760
♪Joyfully going
through the endless years♪

40:12.760 --> 40:15.030
♪A breeze stirs the heartstrings♪

40:15.030 --> 40:17.520
♪Red thread twines around fingers♪

40:17.520 --> 40:19.380
♪We've witnessed blossoms
and braved through snow storms♪

40:19.380 --> 40:21.380
♪And braved through snow storms♪

40:21.380 --> 40:25.400
♪Each moment is hard to forget♪

40:25.400 --> 40:28.080
♪The joys, the innocence,
the fearlessness♪

40:28.080 --> 40:30.550
♪And our very images♪

40:30.550 --> 40:32.550
♪All carefully cherished♪

40:32.550 --> 40:35.640
♪I wish to stand side by side with you♪

40:35.640 --> 40:37.970
♪To watch the sun rise and fall♪

40:37.970 --> 40:39.670
♪And the seasons change♪

40:39.670 --> 40:42.480
♪When the wind kisses us softly♪

40:42.480 --> 40:44.480
♪We snuggle and cuddle♪

40:44.810 --> 40:48.820
♪And you embrace me in your dream♪

40:48.820 --> 40:51.860
♪I wish to hold your hand♪

40:51.860 --> 40:54.520
♪Inviting a spring breeze to become♪

40:54.520 --> 40:55.800
♪An eternal pledge♪

40:55.800 --> 40:58.960
♪I wish the wind could hear♪

40:58.960 --> 41:01.880
♪Our loyalty and love for each other♪

41:01.880 --> 41:03.640
♪It's my wish♪

41:03.640 --> 41:06.640
♪And my sole wish for this life♪

